{
  "info": {
    "name": "Keycloak Modul 02 - Demos",
    "description": "Live-Demos für Modul 02: Protokoll-Standards.\n\n- **Demo 1:** OIDC Discovery & Authorization Code Flow mit PKCE\n- **Demo 2:** Client Credentials Flow",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "keycloak_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:9090",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "realm",
      "value": "demo",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Demo 1 - Authorization Code Flow (PKCE)",
      "description": "OIDC Authorization Code Flow mit PKCE für einen Public Client (demo-spa).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Discovery Endpoint",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{realm}}/.well-known/openid-configuration",
              "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "{{realm}}", ".well-known", "openid-configuration"]
            },
            "description": "Ruft die OIDC Discovery-Konfiguration ab. Hier sieht man alle Endpoints, unterstützte Scopes, Grant-Types und Signaturalgorithmen."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Token Exchange (Auth Code + PKCE)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                { "key": "authUrl", "value": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/auth", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "accessTokenUrl", "value": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "clientId", "value": "demo-spa", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "openid profile email", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "useBrowser", "value": true, "type": "boolean" },
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code_with_pkce", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "challengeAlgorithm", "value": "S256", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "tokenName", "value": "demo_spa_token", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "addTokenTo", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "demo-spa", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "code", "value": "{{auth_code}}", "type": "text", "description": "Authorization Code aus dem Browser-Redirect" },
                { "key": "code_verifier", "value": "{{code_verifier}}", "type": "text", "description": "PKCE Code Verifier (passend zum Code Challenge)" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "{{realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Tauscht den Authorization Code gegen Tokens ein.\n\n**Variante A (empfohlen):** Den OAuth-2.0-Tab von Postman nutzen — dort ist alles vorkonfiguriert. Klicke auf \"Get New Access Token\".\n\n**Variante B (manuell):** Auth-URL im Browser aufrufen, Code kopieren, hier eintragen und absenden."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "    // Access Token dekodieren",
                  "    if (body.access_token) {",
                  "        const parts = body.access_token.split('.');",
                  "        const payload = JSON.parse(atob(parts[1]));",
                  "        console.log('=== ACCESS TOKEN (decoded) ===');",
                  "        console.log(JSON.stringify(payload, null, 2));",
                  "    }",
                  "",
                  "    // ID Token dekodieren",
                  "    if (body.id_token) {",
                  "        const parts = body.id_token.split('.');",
                  "        const payload = JSON.parse(atob(parts[1]));",
                  "        console.log('=== ID TOKEN (decoded) ===');",
                  "        console.log(JSON.stringify(payload, null, 2));",
                  "    }",
                  "",
                  "    // Zusammenfassung",
                  "    console.log('=== TOKEN-TYPEN ===');",
                  "    console.log('access_token:', body.access_token ? 'vorhanden' : 'FEHLT');",
                  "    console.log('id_token:', body.id_token ? 'vorhanden' : 'FEHLT');",
                  "    console.log('refresh_token:', body.refresh_token ? 'vorhanden' : 'FEHLT');",
                  "    console.log('token_type:', body.token_type);",
                  "    console.log('expires_in:', body.expires_in, 'Sekunden');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Demo 2 - Client Credentials Flow",
      "description": "Client Credentials Flow für einen Confidential Client (demo-service). Kein User involviert — nur Machine-to-Machine.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Client Credentials Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "demo-service", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "demo-service-secret", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
              "path": ["realms", "{{realm}}", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Fordert ein Access Token per Client Credentials an.\n\nBeachte im Vergleich zu Demo 1:\n- **Kein** id_token (keine Authentifizierung eines Users)\n- **Kein** refresh_token\n- Im JWT: `sub` ist der Service Account, nicht ein User"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "    // Access Token dekodieren",
                  "    if (body.access_token) {",
                  "        const parts = body.access_token.split('.');",
                  "        const payload = JSON.parse(atob(parts[1]));",
                  "        console.log('=== ACCESS TOKEN (decoded) ===');",
                  "        console.log(JSON.stringify(payload, null, 2));",
                  "        console.log('');",
                  "        console.log('Hinweis: \"sub\" ist der Service Account, kein User!');",
                  "        console.log('preferred_username:', payload.preferred_username);",
                  "    }",
                  "",
                  "    // Zusammenfassung — Vergleich mit Demo 1",
                  "    console.log('');",
                  "    console.log('=== TOKEN-TYPEN (Vergleich mit Demo 1) ===');",
                  "    console.log('access_token:', body.access_token ? 'vorhanden' : 'FEHLT');",
                  "    console.log('id_token:', body.id_token ? 'vorhanden' : 'FEHLT (erwartet!)');",
                  "    console.log('refresh_token:', body.refresh_token ? 'vorhanden' : 'FEHLT (erwartet!)');",
                  "    console.log('token_type:', body.token_type);",
                  "    console.log('expires_in:', body.expires_in, 'Sekunden');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
